Z||000000||Captain Midnight||09-08-2001||02:55 AM||||The 88' Getrags were offered in two gear ratios. I would like to change my final gear ratio to the lower one. Would this ring gear be hard to find used? Anybody have one?<P>------------------<BR>Captain Midnight||||reg||1
