Z||000002||Dave Gunsul||09-08-2001||01:18 PM||||The Barretta trans requires some converting (I think) to make it work in the Fiero.<BR>Also remember that the lower 3.91 gear that I think you're looking for is only found on the quad-4 equipped cars not the regular V6's.<BR>Rodney Dickman has done not only the Barretta<BR>swap but the 3.91 gear swap into a regular Getrag as well. You might want to email him<BR>since he knows a lot about this subject.<BR>Here's his web-site: <A HREF="http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/" TARGET=_blank>www.execpc.com/~rodney1/</A> <P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
